# All API Call List (Updated)

Base URL is environment driven:
- Backend base: `${BACKEND_BASE_URL}` (demo/live switch from `.env`)
- Public image base: `${NEXT_PUBLIC_BACKEND_BASE_URL}`

## 1) Auth APIs

1) Page/Component: `src/components/OtpLogin.jsx`
- Method/Endpoint: `PATCH /auth/update-otp` (via `src/services/auth.js` + `src/services/api.js`)
- Use case: Send OTP to learner mobile number.

2) Page/Component: `src/components/OtpLogin.jsx`
- Method/Endpoint: `PATCH /auth/verify-otp` (via `src/services/auth.js` + `src/services/api.js`)
- Use case: Verify OTP and login learner.

3) API Route: `src/app/api/auth/update-otp/route.js`
- Method/Endpoint: `PATCH ${BACKEND_BASE_URL}${BACKEND_SEND_OTP_PATH}`
- Default path: `/auth/update-otp`
- Use case: Proxy send-otp request to backend.

4) API Route: `src/app/api/auth/verify-otp/route.js`
- Method/Endpoint: `PATCH ${BACKEND_BASE_URL}${BACKEND_VERIFY_OTP_PATH}`
- Default path: `/auth/verify-otp`
- Use case: Proxy verify-otp request to backend.

## 2) Profile APIs

5) Page/Component: `src/app/my-account/page.jsx`
- Method/Endpoint: `GET /api/users/get-learners?learnerID={learnerID}`
- Use case: Fetch latest learner profile for prefill.

6) Page/Component: `src/app/my-account/page.jsx`
- Method/Endpoint: `PATCH /api/users/update-learner` (`multipart/form-data`)
- Use case: Update learner profile fields/files.

7) API Route: `src/app/api/users/get-learners/route.js`
- Method/Endpoint: `GET ${BACKEND_BASE_URL}${BACKEND_GET_LEARNERS_PATH}?learnerID={learnerID}`
- Default path: `/users/get-learners`
- Use case: Proxy learner profile fetch request.

8) API Route: `src/app/api/users/update-learner/route.js`
- Method/Endpoint: `PATCH ${BACKEND_BASE_URL}${BACKEND_UPDATE_LEARNER_PATH}`
- Default path: `/users/update-learner`
- Use case: Proxy learner profile update request.

9) API Route: `src/app/api/languages/route.js`
- Method/Endpoint: `GET ${BACKEND_BASE_URL}${BACKEND_LANGUAGES_PATH}`
- Default path: `/languages/get-languages`
- Use case: Fetch language options (when used by UI).

## 3) Packages & Booking APIs

10) Page/Component: `src/app/packages/packages-client.jsx`
- Method/Endpoint: `GET /api/packages`
- Use case: Fetch package list for tabs (Car/Bike/License).

11) API Route: `src/app/api/packages/route.js`
- Method/Endpoint: `GET ${BACKEND_BASE_URL}/packages/get-packages`
- Use case: Proxy package list/details fetch.

12) Page: `src/app/packages/[id]/page.jsx`
- Method/Endpoint: `GET ${BACKEND_BASE_URL}/packages/get-packages?package_id={id}`
- Use case: Fetch selected package detail.

13) Page: `src/app/packages/[id]/page.jsx`
- Method/Endpoint: `GET ${BACKEND_BASE_URL}/packages/get-packages`
- Use case: Fetch package catalog fallback/related package data.

14) Page: `src/app/packages/[id]/page.jsx`
- Method/Endpoint: `GET ${BACKEND_BASE_URL}/packages/get-add-ons?status=AC&type={type}` (fallback: `?status=AC`)
- Use case: Fetch add-ons for selected package type.

15) Data layer: `src/lib/data.js` (`getPackages`)
- Method/Endpoint: `GET ${BACKEND_BASE_URL}/packages/get-packages`
- Use case: Server-side package fetch for landing/content sections.

16) Component: `src/components/packages/PackageDetailsClient.jsx`
- Method/Endpoint: `POST /api/packages/package-booking`
- Use case: Create booking for license package and start payment flow.

17) API Route: `src/app/api/packages/package-booking/route.js`
- Method/Endpoint: `POST ${BACKEND_BASE_URL}${BACKEND_PACKAGE_BOOKING_PATH}` (`application/x-www-form-urlencoded`)
- Default path: `/packages/package-booking`
- Use case: Proxy package booking request to backend.

